{
  "title": "Warm Sweet Mexican Apricot Stew",
  "description": "A sweet and chewy Mexican stew featuring dried apricots, perfect for a hangover cure, made in a traditional ttukbaegi earthenware cook, and is vegetarian friendly.",
  "cuisine": "Mexican",
  "diet": [
    "vegetarian"
