  "instructions": [
    "Rehydrate the dried apricots by soaking them in water for at least 4 hours.",
    "Heat the ttukbaegi earthenware cook over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Add the diced chipotle peppers, ground cumin, and smoked paprika, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the rehydrated apricots, low sodium vegetable broth, brown sugar, and concentrated tomato paste, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Stir in the chopped fresh cilantro and freshly squeezed lime juice.",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with additional cilantro if desired."
  ],
